## Stack

- **Framework:** Next.js 15 App Router
- **Data:** Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Storage + Realtime)
- **Billing:** Stripe (Checkout + Customer Portal + Webhooks)
- **Email:** Resend
- **Errors:** Sentry
- **Analytics:** PostHog
- **Hosting:** Vercel

Per ARCHITECTURE.md §7 in the Nexural Federation.

## Local development

```bash
# Install deps
pnpm install

# Resolve secrets from 1Password (per recipe.yaml secrets_required)
op inject -i .env.example -o .env.local

# Run Supabase locally
supabase start
pnpm db:migrate

# Run Next.js
pnpm dev   # → http://localhost:3000
```

## Tenant routing

This app uses **{{tenantRouting}}** routing.

- Subdomain: tenant lives at `https://<tenant-slug>.{{rootDomain}}`
- Path: tenant lives at `https://app.{{rootDomain}}/t/<tenant-slug>/`

Configured via `NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_ROUTING` env var; do not change at runtime
without reviewing middleware.

## Deploying

Vercel project linked to this repo's `main`. Deploys auto on push.

```bash
vercel --prod
```

